{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "That is it from this game then! Two more games coming your way on the 4th of this month. The first game begins at 0830 IST (0300 GMT). Till then, goodbye and take care!", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:46:00+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Sabbhineni Meghana, Player of the Game, says she is happy with her knock. Adds she wanted to make most of the chances she got and is pleased with how she played.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:44:58+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Harmanpreet Kaur says she knew the rain might come and that is why they began with the spinners. Credits the way Sabbhineni Meghana and Shafali Verma batted. Adds it is important for Shafali Verma to get her confidence back. Mentions the score they got was a good one on this wicket.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:44:02+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Winifred Duraisingam says they wanted to play the full game. Adds it was a good learning curve for them. Mentions they have not had a lot of opportunities at this level but they enjoyed it.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:43:00+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "... TIME FOR THE PRESENTATION ...", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:42:57+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "THE RAIN HAS STOPPED! THE COVERS ARE OFF! However, we are past the cut off time and the game has been CALLED OFF! It is India who win it by 30 runs by DLS method. India should consider themselves a tad lucky they got in the 5 overs. The clouds were threatening right from the start of the second innings but it came shortly after India completed the five overs they needed to bowl. However, they deserved this victory. Their batters set it up for them. Excellent knocks from Sabbhineni Meghana and Shafali Verma ensured they got to a big score and later on, they unleashed the spinners as the rain was looming around and they needed to get the five overs in and they did the job.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:41:52+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Nothing new to update! The rain continues to come down, chances of a resumption looks unlikely. Fingers crossed though.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-03T10:18:12+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Halt in play as the umpires are have a conversation. The Malaysia Women's baters do not want to come off but the umpires have called for the covers. The rain 